# 4. DESIGN SYSTEM

First create a complete EventHub design system.

Use a modern professional SaaS/marketplace style.

Typography:

Use Inter or Manrope.

Create:

* H1
* H2
* H3
* H4
* Body
* Small
* Caption
* Button
* Label

Create color tokens:

* Primary
* Secondary
* Accent
* Background
* Surface
* Border
* Text
* Muted
* Success
* Warning
* Error
* Info

Use a clean light interface.

Use dark/navy elements for strong branding.

Use one consistent accent color.

Avoid excessive gradients.

Use subtle shadows and rounded cards.

